// endpoint_run_tests.proto — RunTests: run the named tests from one
// workspace's worktree, and stream what the run reports.
//
// THE DAEMON IS THE ONE RUNNER OF TESTS. Every test run on the host goes
// through it — an agent's, through this endpoint, and the merge queue's — so
// every run shares the host's one test-CPU budget, in priority order, and none
// can start outside it. An agent names exactly the tests its change touches
// (testrun.v1.TestSelection reaches a single subtest); the whole roster is
// the merge queue's to run.
//
// THE WORKSPACE'S OWN CODE RUNS. The run builds and runs the runner from the
